WEBVTT

00:13.750 --> 00:16.040
<i>Killing was what gave my life meaning.</i>

00:16.330 --> 00:19.000
<i>It's what made me feel truly alive.</i>

00:19.000 --> 00:22.170
<i>I was standing at the top of this fight for survival.</i>

00:22.170 --> 00:23.580
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

00:23.960 --> 00:25.670
<i>Until...</i>

00:33.290 --> 00:35.580
<i>Now look at me.</i>

00:38.250 --> 00:40.670
<i>The ghouls are wreaking havoc all over town.</i>

00:40.670 --> 00:43.500
<i>I'll take anyone, I'll even take me.</i>

00:43.710 --> 00:47.330
Just let me kill somebody!

00:50.880 --> 00:54.130
Stay out of this, gruntlings!

00:55.750 --> 00:56.960
That's-

00:57.290 --> 00:58.960
<i>That giant cleaver...</i>

00:58.960 --> 01:01.920
<i>That piercing glint in his eye,
full of overwhelming savagery...</i>

01:01.920 --> 01:05.880
<i>It's the ruler of the Black Tower,
Juggernaut the Tyrant!</i>

01:11.210 --> 01:14.880
<i>Those distinctive nine tails,
a symbol of the highest ranking therianthropes...</i>

01:14.880 --> 01:18.130
<i>She's the ruler of the White Tower,
Yukime the Spirit Fox!</i>

01:21.210 --> 01:22.420
They're both major big shots.

01:22.420 --> 01:25.330
I'd have to bend over backwards,
and I'd still never beat 'em!

01:25.460 --> 01:28.250
Why did they have to come over here onto my turf?!

01:34.460 --> 01:36.040
My name is Shadow.

01:37.170 --> 01:40.960
He who lurks in the shadows
in order to hunt the shadows.

01:41.330 --> 01:42.750
Shadow?

01:43.170 --> 01:47.830
The Don of the armed militants who have taken
the Midgar Royal Capital as their turf.

01:47.830 --> 01:52.790
Oh, right, the boss of that gang that
wiped the floor with those snooty priests.

01:53.080 --> 01:56.630
Whatever, that's none of my business!

02:00.670 --> 02:02.380
Catch you later, she-fox.

02:02.380 --> 02:04.130
Next time, I'll kill you.

02:04.130 --> 02:05.710
The moon is red.

02:06.710 --> 02:08.460
The frenzy has begun.

02:08.710 --> 02:10.040
"Frenzy"?

02:10.040 --> 02:13.670
Are you referring to this current
trouble with the ghouls?

02:14.080 --> 02:19.670
Oh yeah, that Red Moon legend where they say
three kingdoms fell when it was in the sky?

02:19.670 --> 02:20.880
Sounds good to me.

02:20.880 --> 02:24.040
In that case, those bats will finally start
to give me a decent workout.

02:24.040 --> 02:25.710
That man...

02:26.420 --> 02:27.960
Well, I'll excuse myself.

02:28.330 --> 02:31.170
It seems you helped some of my girls
in the pleasure district,

02:31.170 --> 02:33.420
so I hope we can remain on friendly terms,

02:33.420 --> 02:34.920
my dear Shadow.

02:36.080 --> 02:38.630
The entire castle gate is an artifact.

02:38.630 --> 02:40.880
How did he break it down with a sword?!

02:41.960 --> 02:43.170
The Tyrant...

02:43.580 --> 02:45.790
And his rival, the Spirit Fox.

02:46.080 --> 02:48.250
They're both after the Blood Queen.

02:48.250 --> 02:50.750
Every single one of them is a
good-for-nothing monster.

02:51.170 --> 02:52.460
You've got to be kidding me.

02:52.460 --> 02:55.000
I wanted to slice up some humans.

02:57.290 --> 02:58.630
That guy...

02:59.040 --> 03:00.540
Who is he?

03:00.540 --> 03:03.000
I don't sense any power from him at all.

03:04.040 --> 03:06.250
That means he's weaker than me.

03:11.330 --> 03:13.290
That settles it!

03:13.290 --> 03:15.170
You're my prey!

03:23.080 --> 03:24.500
<i>What in the...</i>

03:26.210 --> 03:30.630
<i>Who is that guy?</i>

03:34.830 --> 03:36.250
The moon is red.

03:36.830 --> 03:38.500
The frenzy has begun.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.830
We're out of time.

03:41.080 --> 03:43.630
Wh-what in the actual...

03:51.670 --> 03:53.750
That is too late

03:53.750 --> 03:56.670
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

03:56.670 --> 03:58.790
That is to say...

04:01.750 --> 04:07.960
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

04:07.960 --> 04:10.290
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

04:10.630 --> 04:11.750
This way

04:11.750 --> 04:18.000
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

04:18.000 --> 04:20.630
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

04:20.630 --> 04:22.000
It's me

04:22.250 --> 04:24.540
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

04:26.040 --> 04:31.670
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

04:32.960 --> 04:36.750
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

04:36.750 --> 04:39.250
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

04:39.420 --> 04:41.790
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

04:41.790 --> 04:44.380
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

04:44.380 --> 04:46.790
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

04:46.790 --> 04:49.250
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

04:49.540 --> 04:51.920
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

04:51.920 --> 04:54.580
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

04:54.830 --> 04:56.830
That is too late

04:56.830 --> 04:59.750
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

04:59.750 --> 05:01.920
That is to say

05:01.920 --> 05:06.880
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

05:12.170 --> 05:15.000
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

05:16.080 --> 05:21.000
<b>#02 The Haven</b>

05:17.460 --> 05:21.250
If this was the general technology of the time,

05:21.250 --> 05:24.630
then we must conclude that the
Cult's level of technology was extraordinary.

05:25.000 --> 05:28.080
The source of their power was found in the Demon.

05:28.380 --> 05:29.670
That much makes sense.

05:29.670 --> 05:34.250
But where could they have possibly found
the knowledge necessary to harness that power?

05:43.080 --> 05:45.210
I told you not to touch things willy-nilly.

05:45.210 --> 05:47.460
How was I supposed to know
it would turn into a slide?

05:47.790 --> 05:51.080
Anyway, now we have made it
inside the tower successfully.

05:51.540 --> 05:55.710
I can't believe the passage turns into a slide
and connects to this place.

05:57.460 --> 05:59.330
What am I to do now?

06:00.080 --> 06:03.080
I'm supposed to eliminate all witnesses, but...

06:04.080 --> 06:05.670
I don't think I can.

06:06.250 --> 06:09.420
I have no desire to fight you, Miss Claire.

06:09.420 --> 06:11.210
You know me?

06:11.540 --> 06:15.880
You're Claire Kagenou, winner of the
recent Bushin Festival, are you not?

06:17.210 --> 06:19.580
She doesn't seem to be a vampire.

06:19.580 --> 06:22.630
And we don't have time to fight unnecessary battles.

06:23.170 --> 06:24.380
Besides...

06:24.710 --> 06:25.920
She's not alone.

06:25.920 --> 06:29.580
So hey, why does Lady Beta keep hiding her face?

06:29.580 --> 06:31.000
Shh, be quiet!

06:31.130 --> 06:32.330
All right...

06:32.330 --> 06:35.420
Tell us who you are, and what you're doing here.

06:36.920 --> 06:39.460
I am Beta, of Shadow Garden.

06:39.460 --> 06:41.080
Shadow Garden?

06:41.380 --> 06:43.500
The punks who burned down our school?

06:43.880 --> 06:46.420
So what? You're gonna burn the tower down now?

06:48.080 --> 06:51.540
I was doing research on the possessed
for reasons I can't go into.

06:51.540 --> 06:55.250
And for that, I'm hoping for a blood sample
from a Progenitor Vampire.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.790
What do Progenitor Vampires
have to do with the possessed?

06:59.170 --> 07:03.210
When traced back to their origins,
the possessed and vampires are the same.

07:03.210 --> 07:04.880
In the process of descendency,

07:04.880 --> 07:07.130
the bloodlines changed and
split off from one another.

07:07.580 --> 07:10.540
That's the theory we developed in
the process of our research.

07:10.830 --> 07:12.420
To test that hypothesis,

07:12.420 --> 07:14.830
it has become necessary that
we study the Blood Queen,

07:14.830 --> 07:16.460
as she is a Progenitor Vampire.

07:16.960 --> 07:18.920
The possessed and vampires are...

07:19.290 --> 07:21.630
That is blasphemy against the Progenitors!

07:21.630 --> 07:24.080
And why would that make you angry,

07:24.080 --> 07:28.420
my dear thousand-year-old rumor
Miss Ancient Vampire Hunter?

07:28.920 --> 07:30.420
You know me, too?

07:30.670 --> 07:32.880
We will stay out of your way.

07:32.880 --> 07:35.210
And you will stay out of our way.

07:35.630 --> 07:37.830
Can we just leave it at that?

07:39.080 --> 07:40.540
Just tell me one thing.

07:41.000 --> 07:43.290
Is there a way to cure the possessed?

07:45.080 --> 07:48.420
You have absolutely nothing to worry about.

07:48.420 --> 07:49.710
What does that mean?

07:49.710 --> 07:51.170
Exactly what I said.

07:51.830 --> 07:52.830
Fine.

07:52.830 --> 07:54.130
Let's go, Mary.

07:54.130 --> 07:57.330
If we keep wasting time here,
we'll never save my brother.

07:58.580 --> 07:59.880
Your brother?

07:59.880 --> 08:02.210
The people here kidnapped him.

08:02.210 --> 08:04.710
If we don't hurry,
he'll be sacrificed to the Blood Queen.

08:04.880 --> 08:05.380
Well that's...

08:05.380 --> 08:06.380
Is that true?
Well that's...<b></b>

08:06.670 --> 08:07.670
Is it true?! Is Ci-

08:07.670 --> 08:09.000
Number 666...

08:09.670 --> 08:11.500
Stand down, Number 666.

08:11.500 --> 08:12.500
But-

08:12.750 --> 08:14.580
I mean, I'm sorry.

08:14.580 --> 08:16.250
I assume we're done here.

08:16.250 --> 08:18.460
Don't forget to stay out of our way.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.500
You have no desire...

08:24.290 --> 08:26.790
to strive for the Haven once more?

08:28.630 --> 08:29.830
Mary?

08:31.750 --> 08:32.960
Hey, wait...

08:37.080 --> 08:39.710
You disappoint me, Number 666.

08:39.710 --> 08:41.040
My deepest apologies.

08:41.380 --> 08:43.500
And you two are supposed to keep her in line.

08:43.500 --> 08:44.830
We're sorry!

08:44.830 --> 08:46.420
Really sorry!

08:46.830 --> 08:50.460
Our mission is to obtain the sample, nothing more.

08:50.750 --> 08:54.130
Lord Shadow will be the one to
deal with the Blood Queen.

08:54.630 --> 08:58.540
That will eliminate all problems,
including the issue with the sacrifice.

08:58.960 --> 09:01.040
Do you understand, Number 666?

09:01.630 --> 09:02.630
Yes.

09:04.500 --> 09:07.080
<i>Babysitting is part of the job, Beta.</i>

09:16.830 --> 09:18.170
Now! The heart!

09:18.170 --> 09:19.380
I know!

09:25.710 --> 09:29.210
Even an immortal vampire will die
if its heart is destroyed.

09:29.670 --> 09:31.830
And they don't do well in the sun, you said?

09:32.080 --> 09:34.790
You're a vampire hunter, all right.
You really know your stuff.

09:34.790 --> 09:36.460
Let's hurry on.

09:39.500 --> 09:41.380
You're hiding something from me.

09:42.170 --> 09:44.630
You were acting strange back there in the library.

09:44.630 --> 09:47.170
Almost like you were taking the vampires' side.

09:48.210 --> 09:49.790
What are you after?

09:49.790 --> 09:51.130
The Blood Queen.

09:51.380 --> 09:53.830
To vanquish her, right?

09:54.540 --> 09:57.000
I have lived this long only to achieve my purpose.

09:58.000 --> 10:00.630
Then what was she talking about?

10:00.630 --> 10:02.210
What is the "Haven"?

10:02.580 --> 10:05.500
You don't look like an elf, but they've
talked about you for a thousand ye-?

10:05.500 --> 10:07.920
Claire! You aren't any different.

10:08.330 --> 10:11.000
A possessed can never be human again.

10:11.000 --> 10:13.040
It's so obvious, everyone knows it.

10:13.040 --> 10:15.630
Then why would you ask that stupid question?

10:16.500 --> 10:18.420
Everyone has their secrets.

10:18.420 --> 10:19.670
You know that.

10:19.670 --> 10:23.130
I won't pry into yours, and you won't pry into mine.

10:23.130 --> 10:24.540
Can't that be good enough?

10:25.630 --> 10:26.630
What happened?

10:26.630 --> 10:28.080
This magical energy...

10:36.130 --> 10:39.830
They say you have to crush
a vampire's heart to kill it.

10:40.290 --> 10:42.040
But you're still so weak.

10:42.330 --> 10:44.580
I thought this guy was one of
the top brass around here.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.460
Well, whatever.

10:46.460 --> 10:48.460
There are plenty more where he came from.

10:49.460 --> 10:51.080
Hey, losers.

10:51.880 --> 10:54.460
Where can I find the Blood Queen?

11:02.500 --> 11:03.790
That's...

11:03.790 --> 11:05.000
You know him?

11:07.000 --> 11:09.080
Juggernaut the Tyrant...

11:09.080 --> 11:11.540
That's the boss at the Black Tower, right?

11:11.710 --> 11:13.380
And the one he's beating to a pulp

11:13.380 --> 11:15.710
is the third most eminently
powerful vampire in this tower.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.630
And the two in a heap on the floor?

11:17.630 --> 11:20.250
On the left is number five,
and on the right is a Lost Number.

11:20.630 --> 11:22.540
Those titles make them sound tough.

11:23.420 --> 11:26.080
Juggernaut rose to the top,

11:26.080 --> 11:28.130
to become one of the most powerful
people in the Lawless City

11:28.130 --> 11:29.580
through sheer overwhelming violence.

11:29.580 --> 11:30.830
Let's wait until he's gone.

11:30.830 --> 11:32.830
We should avoid a fight with him.

11:33.040 --> 11:35.580
Agreed, let's get out of here before he finds-

11:37.540 --> 11:39.920
I have good instincts, you know.

11:40.210 --> 11:42.420
All right, bat-face.

11:42.420 --> 11:44.540
Die, if you know what's good for you.

11:51.460 --> 11:52.670
Claire!

11:52.670 --> 11:55.250
Don't look away from me!

11:58.250 --> 12:01.080
I thought you'd be better than all those gruntlings.

12:01.080 --> 12:03.080
But maybe my instincts are getting rusty.

12:08.630 --> 12:11.040
You're pretty tough!

12:11.040 --> 12:14.080
Most guys I fight are down after the first punch.

12:14.080 --> 12:17.380
You're the second person who's ever
managed to hit me in the face.

12:17.380 --> 12:19.630
Well, isn't that an honor!

12:20.540 --> 12:21.830
Mary, are you all right?

12:23.420 --> 12:24.630
Oh no...

12:25.420 --> 12:27.670
Mary! Mary, stay with me!

12:28.130 --> 12:29.330
Mary!

12:29.330 --> 12:30.750
It's okay, I know first aid!

12:32.170 --> 12:33.460
I'm all right.

12:34.040 --> 12:36.580
It's just been so long...

12:36.880 --> 12:38.080
Mary?

12:38.540 --> 12:40.380
Sorry, Claire.

12:40.790 --> 12:42.710
Let me suck your blood.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.170
Wh-wh-what are you doing?!

12:55.880 --> 12:57.080
Mary...

13:02.500 --> 13:03.920
Well, well...

13:04.830 --> 13:06.830
That damned bat...

13:09.750 --> 13:12.000
Finally, a real fight!

13:12.000 --> 13:16.630
But I'm still stronger!

13:20.960 --> 13:23.170
It's been so long, the blood isn't assimilating.

13:30.000 --> 13:32.830
<i>I'm sorry, Cid.</i>

13:41.960 --> 13:45.580
What the hell are you doing, Shadow?!

13:49.880 --> 13:51.290
Shadow?

13:52.420 --> 13:54.170
The frenzy has begun.

13:54.920 --> 13:57.170
We have little time remaining.

14:02.630 --> 14:04.790
The hour of awakening is near.

14:05.580 --> 14:06.790
Shadow?

14:07.040 --> 14:09.880
I've heard the Church has marked him as an enemy.

14:10.290 --> 14:12.170
Did he come to help us?

14:15.250 --> 14:18.830
I'm sorry, Claire, for taking your blood.

14:19.500 --> 14:20.710
It's fine.

14:20.710 --> 14:24.170
No, it's actually not fine at all, but never mind.

14:24.170 --> 14:25.380
Mary...

14:25.380 --> 14:27.040
Your secret is that you're...

14:27.790 --> 14:30.750
Yes, I am a vampire.

14:31.500 --> 14:33.380
I'll tell you everything.

14:33.380 --> 14:36.210
Who I am, why I'm here...

14:36.630 --> 14:39.830
And the truth about the Blood Queen.

14:44.500 --> 14:46.710
More than a thousand years ago...

14:47.040 --> 14:49.580
It was a golden age for vampires.

14:50.420 --> 14:53.830
They would hunt the humans,
devour them like animals,

14:53.830 --> 14:56.880
and slurp up their blood, all as if it were a game.

14:57.540 --> 14:59.420
But times changed.

15:00.080 --> 15:05.330
Humans learned the vampires' weakness,
and the hunters became the hunted.

15:05.790 --> 15:10.080
In the blink of an eye, they would vanish
from the face of the Earth.

15:15.330 --> 15:18.580
During that time, the Blood Queen, my Lady Elisabeth,

15:18.580 --> 15:22.380
was living among humans as the
ruler of a small fiefdom.

15:23.290 --> 15:27.750
She wanted to live in harmony with the humans,
and voluntarily gave up blood.

15:28.880 --> 15:32.540
As her subjects, we followed our queen's example
and stopped drinking blood, as well.

15:33.290 --> 15:38.750
As a result, we gradually lost our powers,
but we gained other things in return.

15:39.500 --> 15:42.130
The ability to live in the light of the sun...

15:42.500 --> 15:45.130
Tranquil hearts no different than
those of the humans...

15:45.710 --> 15:47.500
Our thirst for blood waned,

15:47.500 --> 15:50.960
and we were able to live in
a beautiful world filled with light.

15:53.670 --> 15:56.170
But that was not so for Queen Elisabeth.

15:56.710 --> 15:58.920
No matter how far she distanced herself from blood,

15:58.920 --> 16:01.920
the maddening thirst for it never left her.

16:01.920 --> 16:05.130
And when sunlight struck her,
it would burn her skin hideously.

16:05.130 --> 16:06.330
Nevertheless...

16:06.830 --> 16:08.880
Let us build a Haven here,

16:09.420 --> 16:13.500
a land where humans and vampires
can live together in happiness.

16:14.080 --> 16:18.710
The Haven she strove for truly did exist in that place.

16:19.540 --> 16:21.250
I really believed that.

16:22.750 --> 16:26.210
But then came the night, once in a thousand years,
when the Red Moon rose in the sky...

16:27.040 --> 16:30.210
the night that gives vampires tremendous power.

16:30.830 --> 16:36.790
Queen Elisabeth was starving for blood,
and Crimson gave her a single drop.

16:45.750 --> 16:49.040
Queen Elisabeth's frenzy lasted for
three days and three nights.

16:50.040 --> 16:55.000
The Haven disappeared into a pile of rubble,
and three kingdoms suffered catastrophic damage.

16:55.790 --> 17:01.460
I survived by lapping up the blood of the dead,
and went in pursuit of my queen.

17:02.210 --> 17:06.670
By the time I was reunited with her, it was all over.

17:07.210 --> 17:10.290
This mistake must never be repeated.

17:10.920 --> 17:16.130
Scatter my ashes into the ocean,
so that my flesh can never revive.

17:17.330 --> 17:21.290
Queen Elisabeth took a dagger and
stabbed herself in the heart.

17:21.790 --> 17:25.750
If she had been an ordinary vampire,
she would have disintegrated instantly,

17:25.750 --> 17:29.580
but the queen never turned to ash.

17:30.250 --> 17:34.580
There she was, her breath stopped, her heart stilled.

17:35.040 --> 17:38.750
I could neither defy her wishes nor carry them out.

17:39.460 --> 17:44.670
All I could do was vow to watch over her
in her eternal slumber.

17:48.080 --> 17:50.250
I think it was a foolish choice.

17:50.920 --> 17:55.130
Immediately after that, Crimson and his followers
took my Lady Elisabeth from me.

17:55.830 --> 17:59.670
Out of respect for your service in protecting
Her Majesty, I will spare your life.

17:59.670 --> 18:04.750
I pray that you will have chosen to join us by
the next night, a thousand years hence.

18:05.250 --> 18:10.540
And now, indeed, he is attempting to
use her again for his own ambition.

18:11.290 --> 18:14.540
How can I possibly earn her forgiveness?

18:16.670 --> 18:18.250
I'm no better than you.

18:18.580 --> 18:20.670
I might be possessed.

18:21.880 --> 18:24.750
I showed the signs when I was a little girl.

18:25.080 --> 18:27.210
One day, I will become a monster.

18:27.790 --> 18:32.000
I hoped I could help my brother achieve
something before that happened.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.630
That's why I brought him here.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.710
And now it's my fault he's...

18:36.580 --> 18:39.420
If anything happens to him, how can I ever apologize?

18:40.170 --> 18:41.380
Claire...

18:43.170 --> 18:46.170
So, your Haven...

18:46.830 --> 18:48.880
Are you sure you can't build it again?

18:49.330 --> 18:52.170
I don't want to repeat the same mistake.

18:52.540 --> 18:55.920
Besides, I believe that Queen Elisabeth wants to die.

18:55.920 --> 18:58.750
You won't know that unless you talk to her!

18:58.750 --> 19:01.750
I don't think what you tried to build was a mistake!

19:01.750 --> 19:03.170
I don't want to think it!

19:03.500 --> 19:05.790
It's too sad to let it end this way.

19:08.290 --> 19:12.540
So let's go kick this Crimson guy's butt
and get your queen back.

19:12.540 --> 19:13.750
What do you say?

19:14.210 --> 19:15.420
Claire...

19:18.540 --> 19:19.750
Thank you.

19:25.670 --> 19:28.170
I promise we'll rescue your brother, too.

19:28.170 --> 19:32.380
I will do that myself, with panache,
so mind your own business, okay?

19:41.500 --> 19:43.580
My heart is full!

19:44.460 --> 19:46.790
Just what I'd expect from a vampires' treasury.

19:46.790 --> 19:49.040
They've got quite the collection here.

19:49.500 --> 19:52.750
Oh yeah, I think I ran into my sister
back there somewhere...

19:54.380 --> 19:57.420
Oh well, she can take care of herself.

19:57.880 --> 20:00.080
Pan Kogh's famous painting "Slumber Hours."

20:00.080 --> 20:02.290
I got plenty of art - pass.

20:02.920 --> 20:04.130
Jewels...

20:04.130 --> 20:06.460
They can be pretty unwieldy
when they've already been inlaid into stuff.

20:06.460 --> 20:07.670
That's another pass.

20:09.250 --> 20:11.790
And that means my targets are limited.

20:12.000 --> 20:14.500
One coin, the size of a 500-yen piece,
but worth a 100,000 zeni.

20:14.500 --> 20:17.710
Plus, it has the efficiency and reliability factor
of being ready to use as-is.

20:17.710 --> 20:20.420
And most of all, it's extremely portable.

20:20.630 --> 20:23.250
Well, this is the world we live in.

20:23.630 --> 20:29.250
Just like Epsilon pads her chest with slime,
I will pad my slime with coins.

20:30.250 --> 20:32.380
A thousand coins, a hundred million zeni.

20:32.380 --> 20:37.290
I plan to live at least three hundred years,
so that's not gonna be nearly enough.

20:37.500 --> 20:39.580
But I have a boss battle coming up.

20:40.080 --> 20:43.460
I've been showing up fashionably late a lot recently,
and it's starting to get old.

20:43.460 --> 20:45.250
I gotta change it up sometimes.

20:45.250 --> 20:49.130
Operation: "Start the Last Boss Battle Before the Named
Characters Show Up, So They'll See It and Be All,

20:49.130 --> 20:51.500
'Whoa, what an intense battle!
There's no way we can fight like that!'"

20:51.500 --> 20:52.710
is a go!

20:52.790 --> 20:54.000
It's perfect.

20:54.420 --> 20:58.040
They've already announced that this time
the boss is a super powerful vampire.

20:58.040 --> 20:59.250
It's a pretty rare chance.

20:59.250 --> 21:01.750
Maybe I'll make an extra flashy entrance.

21:07.580 --> 21:11.290
Your flesh and bones wasted away,
reducing you to nothing but your heart.

21:11.880 --> 21:14.830
And yet you are still beautiful, My Queen.

21:15.290 --> 21:18.540
Let us paint the world in blood once more.

21:18.540 --> 21:20.380
On this night so befitting us,

21:20.380 --> 21:23.290
a scarlet night of blood and terror...

21:26.080 --> 21:28.000
Now, return to life!

21:28.960 --> 21:30.670
My dearly beloved!

21:30.670 --> 21:33.080
And let us bind ourselves together in matrimo-

21:45.080 --> 21:47.250
The hour of awakening is near.

21:48.250 --> 21:49.920
The frenzy has begun.

22:04.460 --> 22:08.330
An endlessly deep dark night
Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to<b></b>

22:08.330 --> 22:11.170
I thought, as I closed my eyes
Omotte me o tsubutteta<b></b>

22:11.170 --> 22:16.330
Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama<b></b>

22:16.710 --> 22:20.670
A faint light, not too bright
Mabushiku wa nai awai hi<b></b>

22:20.670 --> 22:23.420
But comforting, that's how you were
Kokochi ii sonna anata o<b></b>

22:23.420 --> 22:27.290
Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa<b></b>

22:27.290 --> 22:29.880
Even if I run out of breath
Iki o kirashite<b></b>

22:30.290 --> 22:33.330
And start to stumble
Motsuresou ni natte mo<b></b>

22:33.330 --> 22:35.630
I've never felt this before
Kono kimochi wa hajimete<b></b>

22:35.630 --> 22:39.540
I can't stop the feeling
Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru<b></b>

22:39.920 --> 22:43.380
That I can meet a me I've never seen before
Yokan ga tomaranai<b></b>

22:43.880 --> 22:46.790
I run down the path in front of me
Me no mae no michi o hashiru<b></b>

22:46.790 --> 22:49.880
I run far, even when I'm lost
Tooku, mayotte mo<b></b>

22:49.880 --> 22:53.710
If I look up, you won't have changed
Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide<b></b>

22:53.710 --> 22:56.040
You'll be there
Soko ni iru koto o<b></b>

22:56.040 --> 22:59.000
It may be strange, but I can believe it
Fushigi demo shinjirareru<b></b>

22:59.000 --> 23:02.040
Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
Even on windy days<b></b>

23:02.040 --> 23:06.540
I don't have to try to reach over you
Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii<b></b>

23:06.540 --> 23:08.880
Hey (Did you know?)
Nee (Shitteru?)<b></b>

23:08.880 --> 23:11.920
As all the stars revolve
Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara<b></b>

23:11.920 --> 23:15.170
I keep my sights on you
Anata o mezashiteru<b></b>

23:15.170 --> 23:18.170
Polaris in the Night

23:24.130 --> 23:25.750
The frenzy has begun.

23:26.540 --> 23:28.170
The moon is red.

23:28.460 --> 23:31.250
There is little time remaining.

23:32.330 --> 23:33.540
Little time...

23:35.420 --> 23:36.830
It's just a little time, right?
